  "question": {
    "text": "Three point charges&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;are placed at the vertices of a right-angled isosceles triangle as shown in the figure. If the net electrostatic energy of the configuration is zero, find the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo></math>Take&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.4</mo><mo>]</mo></math><br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/1732_1_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 170px; height: 161px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "-0.6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Net electrostatic energy of the configuration will be<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">K</mtext> <mo>[</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">q</mtext> <mo>&#183;</mo> </msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">q</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mi>a</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mtext> <mo>&#183;</mo> </msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">q</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> <mi>a</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">Q</mtext> <mo>&#183;</mo> </msub> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">q</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mi>a</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>]</mo> </mrow> </math> <math>&#160; <mrow> </mrow></math>Here, <math> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">K</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> <mi>&#960;</mi> <msub> <mi>&#949;</mi> <mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math><br /><br />Putting <math> <mrow> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">U&#160;</mtext> </mrow> </math> =&nbsp; 0 we get,&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math>",
